#: .\templates\privacy\privacy_policy.html:19
msgid ""
"We respect your privacy. We will not sell or share your personal details, "
"including your name, your date of birth, your email address and your "
"password. Messages you send to people on Speedy Net are personal and will "
"not be shared with other people or websites. Your password is saved "
"encrypted on our database."
msgstr ""
"Biz sizning maxfiyligingizni hurmat qilamiz. Biz sizning shaxsiy "
"ma'lumotlaringizni, jumladan, ismingiz, tug'ilgan sanangiz, elektron pochta "
"manzilingiz va parolingizni sotmaymiz yoki ulashmaymiz. Speedy Net orqali "
"odamlarga yuboradigan xabarlaringiz shaxsiy bo'lib, boshqa odamlar yoki veb-"
"saytlar bilan ulashilmaydi. Parolingiz bizning ma'lumotlar bazamizda "
"shifrlangan holda saqlanadi."

#: .\templates\privacy\privacy_policy.html:21
msgid ""
"Your profile on Speedy Net is visible to everyone, but you can choose who to "
"share with your email address and your date of birth. If you signed up for "
"Speedy Match, your Speedy Match profile will only be visible to people who "
"match you according to the settings you have set up on the site, and that "
"you match them according to their settings. Your profile on Speedy Match "
"will not appear on Google and is not visible to people who are not "
"registered to the site."
msgstr ""
"Speedy Net dagi profilingiz hammaga ko'rinadi, lekin elektron pochta "
"manzilingiz va tug'ilgan sanangiz bilan kimni ulashishni tanlashingiz "
"mumkin. Agar siz Speedy Match ga ro'yxatdan o'tgan bo'lsangiz, Speedy Match "
"profilingiz faqat saytda o'rnatgan sozlamalaringizga muvofiq sizga mos "
"keladigan va siz ularni ularning sozlamalariga muvofiq moslashtiradigan "
"odamlarga ko'rinadi. Speedy Match dagi profilingiz Google'da ko'rinmaydi va "
"saytda ro'yxatdan o'tmagan odamlarga ko'rinmaydi."

#: .\templates\privacy\privacy_policy.html:23
msgid ""
"If you have deactivated your account on Speedy Net or Speedy Match, your "
"profile on that site will be removed from the site and you will not appear "
"in other people's search results on the site. Note that deactivating your "
"account on Speedy Net also automatically deactivates your account at Speedy "
"Match. You can deactivate only your account at Speedy Match, in which case "
"your Speedy Net account will remain active. You can reactivate your account "
"after you deactivate it whenever you like."
msgstr ""
"Agar siz Speedy Net yoki Speedy Match saytlarida hisobingizni o'chirib "
"qo'ygan bo'lsangiz, o'sha saytdagi profilingiz saytdan olib tashlanadi va "
"siz saytdagi boshqa odamlarning qidiruv natijalarida ko'rinmaysiz. Shuni "
"yodda tutingki, Speedy Net saytida hisobingizni o'chirish Speedy Match "
"saytidagi hisobingizni ham avtomatik ravishda o'chirib qo'yadi. Siz faqat "
"Speedy Match saytidagi hisobingizni o'chirib qo'yishingiz mumkin, bu holda "
"sizning Speedy Net hisobingiz faol bo'lib qoladi. Hisobingizni o'chirib "
"qo'ygandan so'ng, uni xohlagan vaqtda qayta faollashtirishingiz mumkin."

#: .\templates\privacy\privacy_policy.html:25
msgid ""
"If you want, you can delete your account on Speedy Net. Deleting your Speedy "
"Net account will automatically delete your Speedy Match account as well. To "
"delete your Speedy Net account, log in to Speedy Net, deactivate your "
"account, and then click “Delete Account” (in the “Edit Profile” menu). Fill "
"out the details in the form and confirm. Please note that a deleted account "
"cannot be recovered. Account deletion is permanent and irreversible."
msgstr ""
"Agar xohlasangiz, Speedy Net hisobingizni o'chirib tashlashingiz mumkin. "
"Speedy Net hisobingizni o'chirish Speedy Match hisobingizni ham avtomatik "
"ravishda o'chirib tashlaydi. Speedy Net hisobingizni o'chirish uchun Speedy "
"Net ga kiring, hisobingizni o'chiring va keyin \"Akkauntni o'chirish\" "
"tugmasini bosing (\"Profilni tahrirlash\" menyusida). Shakldagi "
"ma'lumotlarni to'ldiring va tasdiqlang. Iltimos, o'chirilgan hisobni tiklab "
"bo'lmasligini unutmang. Hisobni o'chirish doimiy va qaytarib bo'lmaydigan "
"holatdir."

